      "title": "Research Terminal",
      "icon": "wombatcraft_smp:research_terminal",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "description": [
        "Carry discoveries to the terminal and press Record. Knowledge belongs to you and survives replacing the terminal or changing factions. Record your own carried evidence; recipes and materials remain tradeable."
      ],
