      "title": "Read the stone",
      "icon": "wombatcraft_smp:resonant_prospector",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 0,
      "description": [
        "Use the prospector to locate Resonant Ore in an 8-block cube. It checks loaded terrain only, has 128 scans and a five-second cooldown. Amethyst crafting remains an alternative for established worlds."
      ],
