    {
      "id": "6FD1199C48023A5D",
      "title": "Build the first workshop",
      "icon": "wombatcraft:convergence_forge",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 0,
      "description": [
        "All four processing stations use a six-block wall. Facing the controller, build the bottom row: frame, controller, frame. The top row is cap, frame, cap. For this Forge use brass blocks as frames and crying obsidian as caps. Supply FE and aim a Botania Mana Spreader at the controller. Its six input slots and two output slots accept item pipes."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "78156914242DA3C4"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "66D8E8414A46D237",
          "type": "item",
