      "title": "A market for magic and nature",
      "icon": "kubejs:infused_catalyst",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4,
      "description": [
        "One Arcane Core, one Primal Core and eight source gems produce eight catalysts. Engineers and explorers consume them repeatedly. Set up a player shop or supply a teammate; catalysts are consumed, not permanent upgrades."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "6FA654F9522AD877"
