      "title": "Keep expeditions supplied",
      "icon": "kubejs:field_charge",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 4,
      "description": [
        "Infuse a catalyst, prismarine crystals and glowstone dust into eight Field Charges. Keep charges in your inventory; a projector with no charges does nothing in survival."
