    {
      "id": "618D6453535547B1",
      "title": "A controlled landing",
      "icon": "wombatcraft_smp:astralium_boots",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 8,
      "description": [
        "Astralium Boots halve the fall damage multiplier and now belong to the full Astralium expedition set. They provide 4 armor and 3 toughness; repair with Astralium. Wearing them replaces Aetherium Boots, so you lose the four-piece arcane protection bonus. Visit Convergence: The Arsenal for the complete set and endgame upgrades."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "6235951CCD6B57FE"
