      "id": "6B2991097E14F192",
      "title": "Renewable wings",
      "icon": "minecraft:elytra",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 8,
      "description": [
        "Forge four Astralium, one Stellar Core, sixteen phantom membranes and thirty-two feathers in the Stabilizer. End ships are a discovery route rather than a permanent supply limit. This also supplies the Voyager Sigil."
      ],
