    {
      "id": "1530FB86E5EB509E",
      "title": "Pay for throughput",
      "icon": "ae2:engineering_processor",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 8,
      "description": [
        "The Infuser makes an eight-processor batch in 50 ticks with one flux, twice the FE and twice the mana of the 200-tick Forge recipe. The Stabilizer similarly reduces Astralium from 300 to 75 ticks. Yield stays unchanged; faster factories buy more power and flux."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
