      "x": 0,
      "y": 12,
      "description": [
        "Stellar Cores and flux turn iron into desh, then desh into ostrum. Calorite has its own costly reconstitution recipe. The first Stellar Cores still require all three planetary metals; automation follows discovery or trade."
      ],
